  "body": "I am trying to implement the algoritm for determining an MP3 without ID3 in C#.\n[https://mimesniff.spec.whatwg.org/#signature-for-mp3-without-id3](https://mimesniff.spec.whatwg.org/#signature-for-mp3-without-id3)\n\nSome of the steps in the algoritm described seems to be wrong or are missing, here is what\nI have found:\n\nUnder [To match an mp3 header](https://mimesniff.spec.whatwg.org/#match-an-mp3-header):\n**_\"4. If layer >> is not 0, return false.\"_**\n\nThere seems to be a number missing after the bitshift operator. The bitshift operator takes two arguments in the form of \"x >> n\".\n\nUnder [To compute an MP3 frame size](https://mimesniff.spec.whatwg.org/#compute-an-mp3-frame-size):\n**_\"2. Let size be bitrate \\* scale / freq.\"_**\n\nWhat is _freq_? Nowhere in the document are the variable _freq_ mentioned other than this line.\n\nAnd last, the _\"sample-rate table\"_ looks like this: \n\n**_index    samplerate\n0   44100\n1   48000\nT2  32000_**\n\nWhat does the index _T2_ mean? should not all the indexes be numbers?\n",
